# See https://help.github.com/articles/ignoring-files/ for more about ignoring files.

# dependencies
/node_modules
/.pnp
.pnp.*
.yarn/*
!.yarn/patches
!.yarn/plugins
!.yarn/releases
!.yarn/versions

# testing
/coverage

# next.js
/.next/
/out/

# production
/build

# misc
.DS_Store
*.pem

# debug
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
.pnpm-debug.log*

# env files (can opt-in for committing if needed)
.env*
# 但配置模板必须提交，否则新克隆的人不知道要配什么
!.env.local.example

# vercel
.vercel

# typescript
*.tsbuildinfo
next-env.d.ts

# 存档文件（含个人游戏进度，绝不提交）
*.sl2
*.co2
*.bak
ER0000.sl2
ER0000.sl2.*
analyze-out.txt

# 密钥与凭证 —— 任何形态都不提交
# 实测教训：写"防止密钥泄露"的扫描脚本时，很容易把密钥本身当成
# 匹配样本写进去，结果脚本自己成了泄漏源。所以宁可把这些形态一并挡住。
*.pem
*.key
id_rsa*
.env.local
.env.production
.env.development
*credentials*.json
*service-account*.json
.token
